{
  "id": "poem-59ea7ba9322ac583ec68b79e",
  "title": "朱奴儿",
  "author": "柯丹邱《荆钗记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "［净］因科举离乡半春，从别后断羽绝鳞。",
    "今日天教遇你们，趁良使附归音信。",
    "［合］还历尽山郭水村，指日到东瓯郡。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8170",
